Subject: Backtest hierarchy regression model with different priors
Message-ID: <ULgi8EaDkdA.sZGURLeGCQAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/ULgi8EaDkdA/m/sZGURLeGCQAJ>
