That's the right signature, but the wrong return type.

It needs to be

  real dydt[1];
  dydt[1] <- ...
  return dydt;

so that the value returned matches the declared return type.

- Bob

> On May 5, 2016, at 4:41 AM, Elizaveta Semenova <elizaveta....@gmail.com> wrote:
