I was trying out advi on some dynamic modeling problems, but no matter the tolerance, step size, or samples used for computing the elbo, I end up with biased parameters. I wanted to try the fullrank option instead of meanfield, but this always generates crazy huge elbo's and doesn't seem to head towards convergence. Is this a known problem, or is it possible that fullrank ignores specified inits or something? I understand advi is still experimental...

