Subject: Re: [stan-users] Model consultation for linear mixed effects: Stan mixing really poorly
Message-ID: <91haLl0VxkI.YjtRa6UtCwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <91haLl0VxkI.7gU9zzshCwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
