Subject: Defining parameter sizes dynamically with another parameter?
Message-ID: <9ITa03Sihes.TWOVJrZICwAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/stan-users/c/9ITa03Sihes/m/TWOVJrZICwAJ>
