Hi Philip.  There was no .stan attachment in that email of yours.  I think it could make sense to put a bit of prior in your model.  Just a bit of curvature keeping you away from iffy zones could make a difference.  I understand your desire to make the formulation as general as possible, but sometimes you just have to think of different regions of parameter space as representing different models!
