Hi Kumar,

1) it helps to provide the code -- I was trying to piece together your example, but it isn't complete.
2) is the class f defined in the stan::math namespace? If not, you'll need to change it to:

template<typename Derived>
Derived operator()(const Eigen::Matrix<Derived, Eigen::Dynamic, 1>& theta) const {
  using stan::math::sin;
  return sin(theta(0)*theta(1));
}

Daniel

