>
> Thanks for the answers!!! I'll check what Aki suggested and I'll try Sebastian's implementation. I'll probably have questions soon about some of the calculations. And by the way, I saw some posts where Bob Carpenter mentioned a tutorial that he's working on. Is it available somewhere?
