Subject: Re: [stan-users] Why do I need a parameter for the hypermean...
Message-ID: <k8RT4SJYJv0.LHePoqZiAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
In-Reply-To: <k8RT4SJYJv0.iVv6DHFcAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
References: <k8RT4SJYJv0.iVv6DHFcAgAJ@stan-users.groups.google.com>
